---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Terms of Service - Story Daily Work',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
        Last updated: October 16, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing <strong>Story Daily Work</strong> (<a href="https://work.storydailyview.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://work.storydailyview.com</a>), you agree to comply with these terms of service, all applicable laws and regulations, and agree that you are responsible for compliance with any applicable local laws. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Technical Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The workflow automation guides, spreadsheet data modeling tutorials, AI prompts, and productivity workflows provided on Story Daily Work are intended for educational and informative purposes only. While every effort is made to ensure operational safety and workflow reliability, procedures and formulas are executed entirely at your own risk. Always maintain verified file backups before executing bulk transformation tasks, data pipeline scripts, or system automations. Story Daily Work shall not be held liable for any data loss, formula corruption, or operational disruption.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All original materials, editorial guides, and publications contained on Story Daily Work are protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. Reproduction, redistribution, or automated scraping of content without prior written permission is strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Revisions & Errata</h2>
      <p>
        The materials appearing on Story Daily Work may include technical, typographical, or photographic errors. We do not warrant that all materials on the website are entirely accurate, complete, or current. We may make updates, adjustments, or corrections to published materials at any time without prior notice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable standard legal frameworks, and you irrevocably submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts for any disputes arising hereunder.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
